+// FIFA Street only: the game's D3D swap callback asks for a present interval of 2 in menus,
+// replays and cutscenes, which halves the frame rate on any refresh rate. Capping it to 1
+// shows every frame; 0 leaves the game's own interval unchanged.
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_INT32(guest_present_interval_cap, 1, "GPU",
+                     "FIFA Street only: highest present interval (vblanks per displayed frame) the "
+                     "game's D3D swap callback may use. The game asks for 2 in menus, replays and "
+                     "cutscenes, which halves the frame rate; 1 shows every frame. 0 leaves the "
+                     "game's own interval unchanged.")
+    .range(0, 15);
